{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ship Graveyard Simulator 2: Steam Ships DLC \u2013 New challenges, new secrets of steamships!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three unique steamships:</h2>Take on the dismantling of a ship that once saved human lives, discover the secrets of a one-of-a-kind steam-powered aircraft carrier and face a wreck whose history still stirs emotions around the world. Each ship brings new challenges and hidden treasures to discover<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550840/extras/01.Steam_Ships_DLC.gif?t=1742059445\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lingering coal \u2013 a new challenge on your path</h2>Before you get to the ship construction, a new, additional challenge awaits you in this DLC. The interiors filled with coal require a thorough cleaning - only then will you be able to start dismantling the last hulls<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A magnet on a crane - a free new feature for EVERYONE!</h2>A new tool will make work in the scrapyard easier! Thanks to the powerful magnet mounted on the crane, you will quickly lift and sort heavy elements, speeding up the entire dismantling process.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550840/extras/03.Steam_Ships_DLC.gif?t=1742059445\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New contracts, finds and achievements</h2>Each ship hides valuable items, mysterious documents and extraordinary stories. New missions, hidden treasures and unique achievements await you in the Steam Ships DLC that will test your exploration and dismantling skills.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550840/extras/04.Steam_Ships_DLC.gif?t=1742059445\" /><br><br>Prepare to meet the legends of the sea and discover what their steel hulls hide!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550840/extras/05.Steam_Ships_DLC.gif?t=1742059445\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550840?t=1742059445","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550840/74e23283cc293bebe7e5d6209ca19e7d3944a0bc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742059445","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550840/da5c727026f5f59f29a8a2a3e0d484de9b44f71e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742059445","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550840/da5c727026f5f59f29a8a2a3e0d484de9b44f71e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742059445","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ship Graveyard Simulator 2: Steam Ships DLC \u2013 New challenges, new secrets of steamships!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three unique steamships:</h2>Take on the dismantling of a ship that once saved human lives, discover the secrets of a one-of-a-kind steam-powered aircraft carrier and face a wreck whose history still stirs emotions around the world. Each ship brings new challenges and hidden treasures to discover<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550840/extras/01.Steam_Ships_DLC.gif?t=1742059445\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lingering coal \u2013 a new challenge on your path</h2>Before you get to the ship construction, a new, additional challenge awaits you in this DLC. The interiors filled with coal require a thorough cleaning - only then will you be able to start dismantling the last hulls<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A magnet on a crane - a 